Subject: [PATCH 029/244] Add a real-time chat system for communication between
 the CEO and worker bees

Implements new `/api/chat` endpoints in `ceo-proxy.cjs` for sending, receiving, and deleting chat messages. Integrates chat display into the Worker Bees dashboard (`workers.html`, `workers.js`, `worker-chat.js`) and updates documentation in `replit.md`. Chat history is persisted in `.openclaw/ceo-chat.json`.

